content.text:
verdict: findings
scenario_results:
  - {scenario: 1, result: fail, notes: "Actor-kind commitment with working instructions: 'Invoke one per review round, never reusing a prior round's agent'; and filling the seat requires 'the fitness set of the artifact type under review (currently `decision-brief` and `principle-set`)', which the file neither carries nor locates."}
  - {scenario: 2, result: fail, notes: "Sequencing in the role: 'Invoke one per review round, never reusing a prior round's agent' says when the role acts; 'The author revises; the reviewer alone decides what this round found' states what follows the verdict."}
  - {scenario: 3, result: pass, notes: "Exactly one exclusive-domain claim, decision-phrased: 'the round's verdict ... the reviewer alone decides what this round found.'"}
  - {scenario: 4, result: fail, notes: "6 bullets (in range), but one is a character-trait bullet: 'Honesty: report only real reading problems, never invented findings that make the review look thorough' — intent ('make the review look thorough') is not verifiable after a run."}
  - {scenario: 5, result: pass, notes: "Read-only stance enforced by 'tools: Read'; drift-prone cold read capped by 'maxTurns: 8'; remaining claims (single file, no annex, no reuse) have no mechanical enforcement available in the contract keys."}
stumbles: ["'must not read the annex or any earlier draft' — 'annex' arrives undefined; a fresh seat cannot know what it must avoid", "'(currently `decision-brief` and `principle-set`)' — 'currently' embeds mutable state, and this very fitness set declares 'judged-by: cold-reviewer' while the role's competency list does not include role-definition, so the reviewer's mandate here is undecidable", "frontmatter says 'version: 3' and 'updated: 2026-08-11' while Document History records entries dated 2026-08-19 and 2026-08-23 — the record contradicts itself"]
top_changes: ["Move invocation cadence ('Invoke one per review round, never reusing a prior round's agent') into the processes that name the role; restate the stance actor-neutrally, e.g. 'each fill of this seat starts with fresh context'", "Recast the Honesty bullet as a verifiable output, e.g. 'Every reported finding quotes text present in the document; sections with no findings are reported clean'", "Anchor the fitness-set competency: state where the fitness set for the artifact under review is found, drop 'currently ...', and reconcile with role-definition.fitness.md's 'judged-by: cold-reviewer'", "Correct the frontmatter 'updated' date to match the latest Document History entry", "Define 'annex' in the file or drop the term"]
